<title>UK: Czarnikow sees EU 96/97 sugar output at 17.9 mln t.</title>
<headline>Czarnikow sees EU 96/97 sugar output at 17.9 mln t.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union sugar output will total 17.9 million tonnes raw value in 1996/97, up on the 17.03 million estimated earlier, trade house Czarnikow Sugar said.</p>
<p>Output in 1995/96 was also 17.03 million tonnes, it said in its latest monthly report.</p>
</text>
